    "description": "Ishod Arts, Inc.\nHandcrafted Porcelain Smoking Pipe With Box & Insert Bowls\nHigh-Fire Glazed Porcelain, Circa 1970s\nVintage artistic smoking pipe handcrafted by Ishod Arts, Inc., featuring high-fire porcelain construction with distinctive sculpted relief panels. One side displays a celestial smiling sun surrounded by radiant rays and stars, while the opposite side features an armorial crest shield. Complete with its original satin-lined presentation box, paper guarantee insert, and two removable terracotta bowl inserts designed for convenient cleaning and thermal protection.\nHigh-fire glazed white porcelain body with mottled earth-tone accents and bright orange collar\nDual-sided dark metallic-toned relief plaques depicting sun face and heraldic crest designs\nRemovable black curved stem and two vented terracotta ceramic bowl liners\nIncludes original stamped cardboard box with red satin lining and printed guarantee document\nCondition:\nPorcelain body is structurally sound with no cracks, chips, or restorations. Raised relief ornamentation is crisp and intact. One terracotta bowl insert shows interior residue from prior smoking, while the second insert appears clean. Curved stem attaches securely. Presentation box shows minor vintage surface and corner wear; interior satin fabric and guarantee paper remain well preserved.",
